  <item>
    <title>女性野生动物摄影师│🐸 NO.24 以纪录片探究人与自然，以情感打破文化壁垒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f071146c4561bc21f99e6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f071146c4561bc21f99e6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【🍃本期内容】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“希望所有女生都拥有自由探索自然的权利”-@不靠谱的王大力</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请到野生动物纪录片导演</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a90e0f2e8ac2b532215ecc1?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5b4198e911be10299f8d33ee&amp;apptime=1710233433&amp;wechatWid=6acd0f8da1acf4aecf4de25d113dc03b&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a90e0f2e8ac2b532215ecc1?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5b4198e911be10299f8d33ee&amp;apptime=1710233433&amp;wechatWid=6acd0f8da1acf4aecf4de25d113dc03b&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@不靠谱的王大力</span></a><span>，和我们分享如何拍摄一部自然纪录片，探讨自然纪录片如何推动生态保护，以及在如今的纪录片领域中女性的处境和反抗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，大力也将作为参展嘉宾，参与本播客厂牌</span><strong><span>「此刻洞见」</span></strong><span>联合摄影科学与图像处理先锋软件</span><strong><span>「DxO」</span></strong><span>发起的：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>挑战与共融：女性摄影师眼中的自然与动物 摄影展</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👇👇👇请查收您的观展邀请函</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWvFxqTDlkVE1m1jX09fgahJyX-.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【🛤时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">4:04</a> 从动物园走向布里斯托</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 生态学的意义是什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a> 我的纪录片处女座《与蛙》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtlNxwzUunXMlEk-J2wx45f9bA3n.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自小红书@不靠谱的王大力</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1716">28:36</a> 如何拍摄一部自然纪录片</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 如何在拍摄中保护自然</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a> 野生动物救助的边界之争</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 自然纪录片的分类&amp;意义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3161">52:41</a> 具有开创性的《我的章鱼老师》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3608">1:00:08</a> 自然纪录片如何推动生态保护</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4010">1:06:50</a> 行业中闪光的女性力量</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4370">1:12:50</a> 纪录片领域中女性的处境&amp;反抗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4608">1:16:48</a> 行业中的女性互助</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【📖拓展资料】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%85%A8%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7?fromtitle=One+Health&amp;fromid=57463993&amp;fromModule=lemma_search-box" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%85%A8%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7?fromtitle=One+Health&amp;fromid=57463993&amp;fromModule=lemma_search-box"><span>One Health（中文：同一健康）</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjv-dLUfD09L_JuTzNHfb5itRd7k.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自维基百科</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%86%92%E5%85%85%E8%80%85%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E5%BE%81/11026373" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%86%92%E5%85%85%E8%80%85%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E5%BE%81/11026373"><span>Imposter Syndrome（中文：冒名顶替综合症）</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MjM5NTE1NzYyMg==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MjM5NTE1NzYyMg==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect"><span>山水自然保护中心</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MzI2OTA4NTY0MA==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MzI2OTA4NTY0MA==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect"><span>云山保护</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MzAxOTIyNzYyMg==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MzAxOTIyNzYyMg==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect"><span>猫盟CFCA</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://k.sina.cn/article_2627373652_9c9a8a5402700yd5t.html?from=science" data-url="https://k.sina.cn/article_2627373652_9c9a8a5402700yd5t.html?from=science"><span>《寻找中国最后的无斑雨蛙！》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>IUCN（中文：</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E8%81%94%E7%9B%9F/9126475" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E8%81%94%E7%9B%9F/9126475"><span>国际自然保护联盟</span></a><span>）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.sohu.com/a/656045562_121124518" data-url="https://www.sohu.com/a/656045562_121124518"><span>万物影像保护计划</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>纪录片《王朝》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkqQg2D79c0WtPhBk89wIkB1aHR8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自百度百科</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%AB%C2%B7%E7%88%B1%E7%99%BB%E5%A0%A1/6945717" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%A4%A7%E5%8D%AB%C2%B7%E7%88%B1%E7%99%BB%E5%A0%A1/6945717"><span>大卫·爱登堡</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>纪录片《地球脉动》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrYeRklGIPwE-s2QOtYVvIEo41hL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自BBC Studio</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>蓝筹片（英文：Blue Chip）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>奥斯卡最佳纪录片</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UV411n7b8/?vd_source=92e4ff8ec0dc211efd7f52ede0b8fb5a" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UV411n7b8/?vd_source=92e4ff8ec0dc211efd7f52ede0b8fb5a"><span>《我的章鱼老师》</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqY3Oj4Qzu1_E_iB9peWpy41UTVt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自Netflix</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>纪录片《蓝色星球》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiThOwxVgHskDl2F4KLVXPdBq-wU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自百度百科</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“海洋清道夫”环保品牌</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qw1l-YCHON_MIVE55ele_g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qw1l-YCHON_MIVE55ele_g"><span>「4ocean」</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>纪录片《极地星球》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgwgsdgNHr7XZI9c3tPNmCilsQrW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自Disneyplus</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>女性为主的制作团队作品：纪录片《Queens（中文：野性王后）》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkiq0vovcrBYdbwurDHsVXUyiVYr.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自Disneyplus</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://girlswhoclick.org/" data-url="https://girlswhoclick.org/"><span>Girls Who Click</span></a><span>（中文：女性摄影师联盟）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkBwTGP9NIqMF831wB2JQEF4ZgKA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片引自GWC官网</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🙋‍♀️本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a90e0f2e8ac2b532215ecc1?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5b4198e911be10299f8d33ee&amp;apptime=1710233433&amp;wechatWid=6acd0f8da1acf4aecf4de25d113dc03b&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a90e0f2e8ac2b532215ecc1?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5b4198e911be10299f8d33ee&amp;apptime=1710233433&amp;wechatWid=6acd0f8da1acf4aecf4de25d113dc03b&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@不靠谱的王大力</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🎙️本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@NicoleZ</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【😉联系我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📕小红书：此刻洞见</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮邮箱：Spotoninnovation@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>进听友群，微信添加小助手: SpotOn2023</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🎵本期音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头/尾曲：Beautiful People——Ed Sheeran</span></p>]]></description>
