    <title>女性野生动物摄影师│🐒 NO.23 看见野生动物之美，更看见Ta们的困境</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e04b7fcfdcad8d2c369a9c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e04b7fcfdcad8d2c369a9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【🍃本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们邀请到生态摄影师文迪，和我们分享上山下海的野生动物保护故事，探讨动物园和野生动物保护的关系，以及如何在我们的日常中与更多的野生动物遇见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，文迪也将作为参展嘉宾，参与本播客厂牌：此刻洞见联合摄影科学与图像处理先锋软件DxO发起的：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>挑战与共融：女性摄影师眼中的自然与动物</span></strong><span> 摄影展</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇👇👇请查收您的观展邀请函</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUwyum04P1tFg4DsJhT4naI9h2o.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【🙋‍♀️本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>#</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/600743e16f0bdee04e4a9a34?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmODk4ZDQ2ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjNkNGQyNCJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/600743e16f0bdee04e4a9a34?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmODk4ZDQ2ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjNkNGQyNCJ9"><span>她乡电台</span></a><span> 播客主理人@文迪</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🎙️本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@WQ @NicoleZ</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🐒时间轴】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a></span></strong><span> 做自然的孩子，与生态摄影结缘</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a></span></strong><span> 我在绿色和平当制片人</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a></span></strong><span> 是建水坝还是救孔雀？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1206">20:06</a></span></strong><span> 前往野生动物保护的更前线</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a></span></strong><span> 72只鲎在暴晒中等待救援</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqWheCnLl4Iqj9rHKrxrd-5dB1w3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>一只中华鲎在潮间带滩涂上的非法鱼排中，@文迪 摄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSJZFDZI_Ma9hCokDBIQe04uh-Z.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“美境自然”环保团队正在救助被渔网困住的鲎，@文迪 摄</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a></span></strong><span> 喀斯特山地中的白头叶猴保护</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhF9ljsiyMhaFAJ33Ur30NDO0oK2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>回眸的白头叶猴，@文迪 摄</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2623">43:43</a></span></strong><span> 如何设计优秀的旅游产品</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3061">51:01</a></span></strong><span> 美国动物园如何助力野生动物保护</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3282">54:42</a></span></strong><span> 中国动物园的创新实践（南京红山动物，西宁野生动物园）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkssN1PeI0NHHc_xcZIFwMpZpeZn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>西宁野生动物园的雪豹介绍看板，@NicoleZ 摄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTnUPLGHE4CALI5YWMbg4t6_5MG.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>西宁野生动物园的雪豹打哈欠，@NicoleZ 摄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMzdeMJ5Cjk4vn6P6UBSBPPmNtP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>西宁野生动物园的兔狲介绍看板，@NicoleZ 摄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmRquti84nlUc1nfYCT1tApCYkmb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>西宁野生动物园的兔狲歪头杀，@NicoleZ 摄</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4000">1:06:40</a></span></strong><span> 如何入门野生动物摄影</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4086">1:08:06</a></span></strong><span> 看见野生动物，更看见Ta们的困境</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4265">1:11:05</a></span></strong><span> 叶猴，消防水管和高速公路</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4397">1:13:17</a></span></strong><span> 夜间拍摄野生动物的方法</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4575">1:16:15</a></span></strong><span> 生态旅行让出行体验有更多层次</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4889">1:21:29</a></span></strong><span> 环保领域中的女性困境&amp;解法</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【😉联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>📕小红书：此刻洞见</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮邮箱：Spotoninnovation@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>💬进听友群，微信添加小助手: SpotOn2023</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🎵本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头/尾曲：Beautiful People——Ed Sheeran</span></p>]]></description>
