  <item>
    <title>NO.6 故宫八卦？博物馆人最知道！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65115a2550cf691d249bb404</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65115a2550cf691d249bb404</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Sep 2023 10:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，我们邀请到毕业于社科院故宫学的阿龙，来一起探索故宫的历史和秘密。</span></p><span></span><p><span>故宫作为北京的第一热门景点，吸引了无数游客前来参观。但是，游客们往往只是匆匆走过中轴线，随机走进几扇开着的宫门，错过许多精彩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期节目中，我们将和阿龙一起八卦正史里的故宫，探索故宫不为人知的秘密。比如：故宫非开放区域里藏着什么？乾隆是不是海王？同时，我们还将深入思考博物馆热现象，分析博物馆如何打造爆款文化衍生产品并引领文化风潮。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期主播】@NicoleZ</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>【👏本期嘉宾】阿龙，「追忆老北京」播客主播</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>【👑时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 故宫学学什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a> 故宫不开放区域里有什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 故宫中秋大典盛况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 京都西芳寺&amp;祗园祭体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> 故宫里的春节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 皇帝养生秘笈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">35:38</a> 北京百年老字号饭庄和皇宫的渊源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> 关于甄嬛，富察氏和小燕子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a> 皇帝的防身大法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3681">1:01:21</a> 博物馆热的原因和影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">1:04:32</a> 博物馆文化衍生服务发展趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">1:07:02</a> 风口上的博物馆们需要警醒什么</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【📚拓展资料】</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>北京砂锅居名菜-砂锅白肉</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FijKtU0pT3YJlGg8aJvqS9uMGLhS.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>富华斋饽饽的端午限定-五毒饼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYletmg0vyfpYz51cYrwTOmcnc8.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>雍正的卧室盲盒-圆明园建筑“万方安和”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDoTdEzhV-00Kz7mXrD-IDgkxb_.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>【😉联系我们】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/646f3c22000000001c02b5e7?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b4198e911be10299f8d33ee&amp;apptime=1694693664" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/646f3c22000000001c02b5e7?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b4198e911be10299f8d33ee&amp;apptime=1694693664"><span>@此刻洞见</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📮邮箱：Spotoninnovation@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🎵本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>片头片尾曲：Beautiful People</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpKYjoZKPNVFSXm1rsH5_nqgZisB.m4a" length="69557596" type="audio/mp4"/>
